proton-autogen (3.2.5) noble; urgency=medium

  * Thanks to all users and contributors for their continued support, feedback and bug reports.
  * Improved Dashboard responsiveness and overall application navigation.
  * Added ReShade shader support for dx9opengl profiles, allowing ReShade shaders and textures to be properly integrated and managed within these environments. (https://github.com/crosire/reshade-shaders)
  * Added a process manager to Proton-Autogen, providing improved process tracking and allowing applications launched through Proton-Autogen to be properly stopped and cleaned up.
  * Improved application lifecycle management, ensuring related processes are handled correctly when stopping applications.
  * Improved compatibility and environment handling for dx9opengl profiles.
  * Improved process cleanup and termination handling for a more reliable application shutdown experience.
  * Expanded UX internationalization with new translations for German, Spanish, Portuguese, Ukrainian, Hindi, Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Russian, Polish, Dutch, Greek, Finnish and Italian.
  * Improved user-facing UX messages with clearer launch, execution, completion and error status feedback.
  * Improved environment loading performance, reducing startup overhead and making runtime initialization faster.
  * Improved system and environment detection performance, reducing unnecessary checks and speeding up Proton and Wine environment discovery.
  * Optimized game and runtime detection workflows for faster Dashboard loading and improved responsiveness.
  * Improved Proton runtime selection and environment initialization for a smoother launch experience.
  * General UX improvements, performance optimizations and code cleanup.

 -- N3oray <n3oray77@gmail.com>  Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:34:00 +0200
